  "The whsec_... secret of a webhook created in Clay's settings, used to verify every delivery. Leave empty for an HTTP API column, which cannot sign requests.": "The whsec_... secret of a webhook created in Clay's settings, used to verify every delivery. Leave empty for an HTTP API column, which cannot sign requests."
